        {
          "path": "_m/8/7/z/c/halona-blowhole-wp/halona-blowhole-2853678319.jpg",
          "filename": "Halona Blowhole (2853678319).jpg",
          "caption": "Halona Blowhole: Every day visitors flock here to see this particular Hawaiian natural wonder, and for very good reason. The blowhole was formed by lava tubes that run into the ocean. When the surf is right (usually high tide) water is forced through the lava tube and comes gushing out the top, sometimes up to thirty feet high. The name \"blowhole\" comes from a whale’s blowhole, which acts in the same principle except for breathing purposes where whales blow out air to breathe.",
          "alt": "Halona Blowhole: Every day visitors flock here to see this particular Hawaiian natural wonder, and for very good reason. The blowhole was formed by lava tubes that run into the ocean. When the surf is right (usually high tide) water is forced through the lava tube and comes gushing out the top, sometimes up to thirty feet high. The name \"blowhole\" comes from a whale’s blowhole, which acts in the same principle except for breathing purposes where whales blow out air to breathe.",
          "width": 1280,
          "height": 853,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Cliff from Arlington, Virginia, USA",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Halona_Blowhole_(2853678319).jpg",
          "sourceType": "commons-category",
          "sourceArticleId": "halona-blowhole-wp",
          "sourceGeohash4": "87zc",
          "smallPath": "_m/8/7/z/c/halona-blowhole-wp/halona-blowhole-2853678319-small.webp"
        },
        {
          "path": "_m/8/7/z/c/halona-blowhole-wp/halona-blowhole-2854513174.jpg",
          "filename": "Halona Blowhole (2854513174).jpg",
          "caption": "You cannot actually get to the blowhole itself, so the best place to actually view the blowhole is at the lookout. From the lookout you can not only easily view the blowhole, but also have some truly breathtaking views of the east side of the island. In addition to spectacular views, keep an eye out for some of the local wildlife. During the winter time the look out at Halona Blowhole is an excellent place to views humpback whales.",
          "alt": "You cannot actually get to the blowhole itself, so the best place to actually view the blowhole is at the lookout. From the lookout you can not only easily view the blowhole, but also have some truly breathtaking views of the east side of the island. In addition to spectacular views, keep an eye out for some of the local wildlife. During the winter time the look out at Halona Blowhole is an excellent place to views humpback whales.",
